&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a Senior Solutions Engineer (Segment) who will drive technical success in the pursuit of large and strategic opportunities within their areas of expertise, resulting in increased revenue. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer, your key area of responsibility will be driving technical pre-sales success across large and strategic fleet opportunities. You will be responsible for running discovery sessions, technical demos, pilots, and proof-of-concepts, while positioning Geotab solutions by understanding customer business challenges and identifying the best fit. You will also develop segment-specific knowledge contributing to playbooks and knowledge bases, lead strategic projects with partners and third-party integrators, and provide market feedback to Product Management. You will need to work closely with Business Development Managers, Business Segment Managers, Account/Engagement Managers, the Signature Accounts Team, Product Management, and other Solutions Engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To be successful in this role you will be a self-starter with strong communication and presentation skills, able to articulate complex concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences. In addition, the successful candidate will have a customer-focused mindset, strong problem-solving abilities, and the business acumen to drive revenue through pre-sales engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain comprehensive knowledge of the Geotab ecosystem, serving as a Subject Matter Expert (SME) to empower end-users and partners (through the channel team) and enhance their understanding of Geotab solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Educate and collaborate with the channel team, enabling partners and end-users to optimize their utilization of Geotab&#39;s technology, products, and solutions, tailoring the approach to meet their specific needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Business Development as the technical prime to drive Geotab&#39;s continued growth with large/enterprise fleets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Run technical pre-sales activities ranging from discovery, technical demos, pilots, POC&#39;s (but not limited to) enabling enriching customer engagement experience maximizing the chances of a sale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Assess and analyze prospect business challenges, identifying Geotab&#39;s viability and defining Geotab solutions to meet those needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop segment knowledge (per segment) contributing to playbooks and knowledge base to drive large/complex prospect opportunities, feeding the channel team to drive partner based opportunities that fall under segment categorisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are an expert in one or more segments, consulted by your peers, and work with Segment Managers on go to market strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and implement methods for automation and standardization for demonstrations and implementations based on Segment expertise and business requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of the company&#39;s offerings by providing segment based feedback, through knowledge and customer/prospect engagement to the Product Management teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain and develop a smooth transition plan to the channel teams, upon acquisition of a prospect to a customer to ensure service and solution goals are met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Geotab revenue generating teams to identify and deliver effective solutions for customer challenges, by working closely with them and their partners, contributing to sales growth, ecosystem expansion and customer retention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure documentation and reporting of prospective opportunities and projects are tracked using standards (JIRA &amp;amp; Salesforce) to enable communication flows and workload management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are able to work independently with minimal guidance from your manager, receiving validation on your solution proposals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead and oversee strategic projects, collaborating closely with partners, third-party integrators, and customers to ensure seamless implementation, deployment, and success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor and support Solutions Engineers and other team members, sharing knowledge, expertise, and best practices to promote skill development and professional growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5–8 years of experience in a relevant technical field, such as Solutions Engineering, Sales Engineering, Engineering Support, Software Development, Automotive Engineering, Data Science, Technical Account Management, or Business Development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Business acumen and a desire to drive revenue growth through prospect and pre-sales engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Effective problem-solving and critical thinking abilities, with the capacity to assess customer challenges and propose viable solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams, including sales, product development, and customer support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A customer-focused mindset, with a commitment to understanding client needs and delivering exceptional service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with sales or business development, with the ability to identify and pursue potential opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #66788c;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, including the ability to articulate complex concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Time management and organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects and priorities simultaneously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of successful customer engagements, project management, and team collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in mentoring, guiding and leading team members to better solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to maintain and grow technical knowledge to the level of a subject matter expert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to lead and create training sessions for audiences with a variety of technical backgrounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How we work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;At Geotab, we have adopted a&amp;nbsp;flexible hybrid&amp;nbsp;working model in that we have systems, functions, programs and policies in place to support both in-person and virtual work. However, you are welcomed and encouraged to come into our beautiful, safe, clean offices as often as you like. When working from home, you are required to have a reliable internet connection with at least 50mb DL/10mb UL. Virtual work is supported with cloud-based applications, collaboration tools and asynchronous working. The health and safety of employees are a top priority. We encourage work-life balance and keep the Geotab culture going strong with online social events, chat rooms and gatherings. Join us and help reshape the future of technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that ensuring diversity is fundamental to our future growth and progress and is an integral part of our business. We believe that success happens where new ideas can flourish – in an environment that is rich in diversity and a place where people from various backgrounds can work together. Geotab encourages applications from all qualified individuals. We are committed to accommodating people with disabilities during the recruitment and assessment processes and when people are hired. We will ensure the accessibility needs of employees with disabilities are taken into account as part of performance management, career development, training and redeployment processes. If you require accommodation at any stage of the application process or want more information about our diversity and inclusion as well as accommodation policies and practices, please contact us at ----- By submitting a job application to Geotab Inc. or its affiliates and subsidiaries (collectively, “Geotab”), you acknowledge Geotab’s collection, use and disclosure of your personal data in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uE3uV2SSp0YnYx4utU9QdhN8Q_RzqMphI_pVJyVWQn8/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to read our Privacy Notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Journey Activation department requires a Senior Associate, Analytics to support the Analytics Manager, the Analytics Director, and the rest of the Analytics team to define and deliver best practice Campaign Reporting, Analytics, and Optimization solutions across WPP Media client requirements. The Senior Associate, Analytics will also advise where possible on the appropriate use of technology, and contribute to the identification of new client opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Combining data and technology to inform analytics and insights for WPP Media’s clients is a crucial part of our commitment to driving better decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Analytics Manager, the Analytics Director and WPP Media clients to identify analytical requirements and solve challenges effectively and efficiently, supporting external resource to do this when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and delivery of existing and new reporting, BI &amp;amp; Analytics projects, including the response to client briefs, securing and analysing required data, preparing the story and visualisation, and presenting to internal and external stakeholders where necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become familiar with the existing Analytics toolset to utilize on client business, including data visualisation technologies (Power BI, Data Studio), reporting and analysis tools (Microsoft Excel, Google BigQuery, Google Analytics), and Data Integration pillars (SQL, Azure), and build an awareness in clients’ business, systems and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within, and help develop, an open, collaborative, progressive day to day culture within Analytics, WPP Media’s clients, and develop strong relationships across the Analytics team, across the wider Journey Activation department and the agency as a whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to support Graduates, Work Experience Students, Interns and other temporary resource in the Analytics team where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media, data and technology industry experience or awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real passion for data, analytics and technology, and for learning new skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in AI – and how it can be used to solve problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills, both within WPP Media and externally with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to distil data into insight and valuable information, and to present back findings in a clear, engaging and meaningful way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding or awareness of digital media (adserving, cookies, pixels), data visualisation and dashboarding, web analytics, data manipulation and statistical analysis software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on experience with relevant technologies (e.g., Power BI, Tableau, Data Studio, Datorama, Google Analytics, Advanced Excel, SQL, R) would be useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11625 - Director, Partnerships, Global&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Partnerships Director role is the link between our Global Investment specialists and WPP Media and agency Client Account teams, working to define and deliver joint business plan (JBP) partnership opportunities for key global clients, primarily The Coca Cola Company but with the opportunity to expand to other brands such as Ford, Colgate and Estee Lauder.&amp;nbsp; This role will also work in tandem with Strategy leads and Account teams to identify relevant media partners, to then develop integrated investment strategies with, delivering best in class, progressive, strategic client partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aided by support from the broader team, the Partnerships Director will define client’s JBPs with media partners, such as Google, Amazon, Pinterest, Meta and TikTok, to maximise client benefits, and then work to deliver these commercial and strategic benefits, throughout the year.&amp;nbsp; Cooperation with, and co-ordination of, local and regional market teams will be central to this, to ensure a consistent approach and successful execution of the negotiated benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will require high levels of relationship management, strategy, coordination and organization as it will involve management of a complex client and agency structure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Partnerships Director &lt;/strong&gt;will need to gain a deep understanding of our client’s businesses and will need to apply their digital (and to a lesser extent, offline) landscape and strategic knowledge to ensure that the client partnership team delivers the most effective plans to deliver on the client’s objectives and the changing entertainment marketing landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They will be responsible for managing partner relationships with the key digital vendors (Meta, Amazon, Google, etc.) to ensure that our clients gain maximum benefits from trading deals brokered and JBPs. Measurement is a key part of the role, so this role is also responsible for ensuring that digital investment associated with the JBPs is tracked and reported back to the client, to ensure full transparency of pacing versus any investment endeavours in place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Global Head of Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Skills &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively within the WPP Media network, and specialist practice departments e.g. DPAM teams, Brand Safety and Governance, , to deliver innovative and media-first, cross media Global JBP opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of media landscape working closely with on and offline Global partners, to ensure first mover opportunities are leveraged for client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in development and monitoring of opportunities with key vendors in the Diversity, Sustainability and Inclusion space, helping to grow client spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key areas of partnership growth and work collaboratively with client teams, as an extension to their strategy &amp;amp; planning teams, to deliver and activate Global JBPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the deployment and monitoring of Global JBPs, across local markets and regions, to ensure targets are met and value is unlocked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an ability to build and maintain strong working relationships with clients, global media vendors, proprietary&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;media opcos and internal teams, to drive collaboration and best in class delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and sell partnerships persuasively and with confidence, passion and enthusiasm to both clients and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Excellence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present confidently, with gravitas &amp;amp; impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively share global marketplace updates and work with markets to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support where needed in new business pitches and proposals, supporting client and strategy teams in content partnership proposals in group pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General tasks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a full understanding of in all areas of the WPP Media and agency suite of products and services, in order to speak confidently with clients about them, ultimately increasing client adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver best in class JBPs, ensuring client value, innovation and excellence are delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop global integrated investment strategy and then actively work with regional and local leads to deploy in markets, adapting as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Regional and Market leads to support in roll out of investment frameworks &amp;amp; JBP benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop best in class campaign measurement frameworks and build out case studies of the best case studies, to be socialized within local and regional teams, as well and with the client directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deploy, and monitor client’s global inclusive marketing investment roadmap, partnering with global strategy and integrations leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global lead on media quality processes and governance and ensure same rigor applied to all media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively scout for new opportunities bespoke to the GroupM client set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage monthly partner investment pacing against agreed JBP endeavours, ensuring correct framework is in place to hit spend thresholds across regions and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief and manage set up of client QBR and JBP reviews coordinating with regions and markets where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with both clients as well as internally at WPP Media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with media vendors, proprietary&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;media opcos and internal stakeholder teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, motivate and encourage growth and skillset of junior members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading by example, with integrity and good citizenship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive and passionate approach that motivates the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently owning and managing relationships confidently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition and drive to execute new ideas and be at the forefront of new industry developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
